		<div class="alert bg-base-200 mb-6">
			<p class="text-base-content/90">
				I'm a developer who loves building cool stuff with technology. I enjoy
				diving into new tools and frameworks that help me create better
				solutions. What really gets me excited is seeing how tech like machine
				learning and AI can solve everyday problems in clever ways. I'm always
				tinkering with code, testing new approaches, and learning from both
				successes and failures. The tech world moves fast, and that's exactly
				why I love it - there's always something new to discover and master.
				When I'm not coding, I'm exploring tech communities, sharing ideas, and
				looking for inspiration that might spark my next project. For me,
				development isn't just work - it's a passion that keeps me curious and
				creative every day.
